(7456620, 1181207, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing study that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Good sharp accurate focus of this vividly coloured little fellow, what bird wench could possibly resist him! My initial reaction is that the background is a little distracting but then it could be argued it adds interest to what would otherwise be a plain background. Because it is obviously part of the tree on which he is sat I would say it adds to the overall effect. His alert posture certainly adds impact to the image. Well seen and taken.</td>', 'Hello from the Critique club An appealing study that meets the challenge well. Good sharp accurate focus of this vividly coloured little fellow, what bird wench could possibly resist him! My initial reaction is that the background is a little distracting but then it could be argued it adds interest to what would otherwise be a plain background. Because it is obviously part of the tree on which he is sat I would say it adds to the overall effect. His alert posture certainly adds impact to the image. Well seen and taken.', '2016-05-25 13:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
