(7456782, 1181376, 113591, '<td valign="top">I only gave it 7, so second-highest score. The bush puts you in the picture as an unseen observer. Not part of, but wanting to. Like Sabrina in her tree, looking onto the next door party.<br/></td>', 'I only gave it 7, so second-highest score. The bush puts you in the picture as an unseen observer. Not part of, but wanting to. Like Sabrina in her tree, looking onto the next door party.', '2016-05-26 02:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
